        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_02",
      "hash64": "D8FBAB79A04922BC",
      "text": "Tiens, mais c’est [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nTu m’as l’air plus fort[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e que la dernière fois !\\r\\nEst-ce que mon impression est juste ?[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_03a",
      "hash64": "FCCA20AB5C4843CA",
      "text": "Eh bien, tu ne manques pas d’assurance !\\nMais, blague à part, ça se voit que tu as changé.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_03b",
      "hash64": "FCCA1FAB5C484217",
      "text": "Vraiment ?\\nPourtant, on dirait que tu as un peu changé.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_04",
      "hash64": "D8FBA979A0491F56",
      "text": "Je suis sûre que c’est parce que ta Chasse au\\nTrésor te permet de vivre de folles aventures ![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_05",
      "hash64": "D8FBAA79A0492109",
      "text": "Allez, raconte-moi un peu tout ce qui t’est arrivé ![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_06",
      "hash64": "D8FBA779A0491BF0",
      "text": "Ouah, ça alors ! Je n’imaginais pas que tu vivais\\ndes aventures aussi géniales ![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_07",
      "hash64": "D8FBA879A0491DA3",
      "text": "C’est impressionnant, l’énergie que vous avez,\\nvous, les jeunes...\\c\\nChaque jour, vous relevez un nouveau défi,\\nl’air de rien.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_08",
      "hash64": "D8FBB579A04933BA",
      "text": "Alors que moi, de mon côté...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_09",
      "hash64": "D8FBB679A049356D",
      "text": "Tu sais, mon rêve, c’était d’être enseignante...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_10",
      "hash64": "D8FF3379A04C3FAB",
      "text": "Mais j’ai fini par devenir infirmière...\\nDonc je ne peux pas donner de cours.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_11",
      "hash64": "D8FF3279A04C3DF8",
      "text": "J’ai bien essayé de passer l’examen pour devenir\\nprof, mais j’ai échoué...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_12",
      "hash64": "D8FF3579A04C4311",
      "text": "À vrai dire, je l’ai même passé plusieurs fois...\\nMais j’accumule les échecs...\\c\\nAlors voilà, je me suis retrouvée coincée ici,\\nà l’infirmerie...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_13",
      "hash64": "D8FF3479A04C415E",
      "text": "Mais qu’est-ce que je raconte ? Désolée de\\nt’ennuyer avec mes histoires déprimantes...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_health_b_14",
      "hash64": "D8FF3779A04C4677",
      "text": "On peut dire que tu es doué[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e pour écouter\\nles autres !\\c\\nTu as beau être un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e élève, je me suis livrée à toi\\nsur un sujet qui me tient vraiment à cœur.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
